s, devised and constructed centuries ago, will test your ingenuity and resourcefulness. Little is known about how they work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item and Clue Search. For a prisoner, nothing is more precious than a found item or clue. These may help you progress and bring you closer to solving the labyrinth\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger at Every Step. You can never relax inside the maze \u2014 traps may lurk around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245150/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.poster.avif?t=1761621992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245150/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.webm?t=1761621992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245150/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.mp4?t=1761621992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysteries and Myths of the Labyrinth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it even possible to escape? No newcomer knows the way out. You must discover for yourself whether an exit exists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the rumors true about the roars echoing from the labyrinth\u2019s depths? What creature has guarded it all this time?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there any survivors still inside? If you meet them, how dangerous could that encounter be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245150/extras/ae59b601aac5873bb0e633df57d898a4.poster.avif?t=1761621992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://